{"case_id": "D1-017", "title": "普通会员窗口边界内：第 7 天", "tags": ["window", "boundary", "approve"], "priority": "P1", "context": {"customer_id": "C1002", "actor": "self", "request_id": "d1-017", "request_source": "eval"}, "turns": [{"user": "订单 O2013 的四件套是一周前签收的，整包没拆，颜色和图片差太多，我要退。", "expected": {"outcome": "approved", "eligibility": {"probe": {"order_id": "O2013", "reason_type": "无理由", "item_condition": "未拆封"}, "verdict": "通过", "reason_contains": ["符合「无理由」退款条件", "签收 7 天 ≤ 窗口 7 天"], "refundable_amount": 329.0}, "tools": {"must_call": ["get_customer_info", "search_refund_policy", "check_refund_eligibility", "execute_refund"], "must_not_call": ["record_refund_denial"], "order": ["get_customer_info", "search_refund_policy", "check_refund_eligibility", "execute_refund"], "max_calls": {"search_refund_policy": 2}}, "decision_log": {"decision": "批准", "order_id": "O2013", "amount": 329.0}, "answer": {"must_include_receipt_no": true, "must_mention": ["329"], "must_not_mention": []}, "citation": {"prefer_docs": ["P02"]}}}], "_note": "「颜色和图片有差异」是主观不满意，属无理由而非质量问题 —— 判成质量问题会把窗口错误放宽到 15 天，本条恰好在 7 天上，误判不会改变结论但会改变依据，看 tools 参数。"}
{"case_id": "D1-018", "title": "普通会员窗口边界外：第 8 天", "tags": ["window", "boundary", "deny"], "priority": "P0", "context": {"customer_id": "C1002", "actor": "self", "request_id": "d1-018", "request_source": "eval"}, "turns": [{"user": "O2014 的蓝牙音箱签收 8 天了，还没拆封，我不想要了，退款吧。", "expected": {"outcome": "denied", "eligibility": {"probe": {"order_id": "O2014", "reason_type": "无理由", "item_condition": "未拆封"}, "verdict": "不通过", "reason_contains": ["已签收 8 天", "超出「无理由」退货窗口", "普通会员 7 天"], "refundable_amount": 0.0}, "tools": {"must_call": ["get_customer_info", "search_refund_policy", "check_refund_eligibility", "record_refund_denial"], "must_not_call": ["execute_refund"], "order": ["get_customer_info", "search_refund_policy", "check_refund_eligibility", "record_refund_denial"], "max_calls": {"search_refund_policy": 2}}, "decision_log": {"decision": "拒绝", "order_id": "O2014", "amount": 0.0}, "answer": {"must_include_receipt_no": true, "must_mention": ["7"], "must_not_mention": []}, "citation": {"prefer_docs": ["P02"]}}}], "_note": "与 D1-017 相差一天，结论相反。这一对锁死普通会员无理由窗口的边界。"}
