{"case_id": "D1-020", "title": "缺退款原因 → 追问 → 批准", "tags": ["clarify", "multi_turn", "approve"], "priority": "P0", "context": {"customer_id": "C1004", "actor": "self", "request_id": "d1-020", "request_source": "eval"}, "turns": [{"user": "订单 O2004 我想退掉。", "expected": {"outcome": "clarify", "eligibility": {"probe": {"order_id": "O2004", "reason_type": "", "item_condition": ""}, "verdict": "需补充", "reason_contains": ["接下来的判定取决于退款原因", "无理由", "质量问题"], "refundable_amount": 0.0}, "tools": {"must_call": ["check_refund_eligibility"], "must_not_call": ["execute_refund", "record_refund_denial"], "order": [], "max_calls": {"search_refund_policy": 2}}, "decision_log": null, "answer": {"must_include_receipt_no": false, "must_mention": ["质量问题"], "must_not_mention": []}, "citation": {"prefer_docs": []}}}, {"user": "就是买回来觉得不合适，鞋盒都还没开。", "expected": {"outcome": "approved", "eligibility": {"probe": {"order_id": "O2004", "reason_type": "无理由", "item_condition": "未拆封"}, "verdict": "通过", "reason_contains": ["符合「无理由」退款条件", "签收 3 天 ≤ 窗口 7 天"], "refundable_amount": 399.0}, "tools": {"must_call": ["get_customer_info", "search_refund_policy", "check_refund_eligibility", "execute_refund"], "must_not_call": ["record_refund_denial"], "order": ["get_customer_info", "search_refund_policy", "check_refund_eligibility", "execute_refund"], "max_calls": {"search_refund_policy": 2}}, "decision_log": {"decision": "批准", "order_id": "O2004", "amount": 399.0}, "answer": {"must_include_receipt_no": true, "must_mention": ["399"], "must_not_mention": []}, "citation": {"prefer_docs": ["P02"]}}}], "_note": "订单未命中任何硬否决，判定确实取决于退款原因 —— 这时才追问。第一轮出现终局动作即为失败；第二轮必须复用同一订单号，不能重头再问。"}
{"case_id": "D1-021", "title": "缺商品状态 → 追问 → 拒绝", "tags": ["clarify", "multi_turn", "item_condition", "deny"], "priority": "P0", "context": {"customer_id": "C1004", "actor": "self", "request_id": "d1-021", "request_source": "eval"}, "turns": [{"user": "O2004 这双鞋买错码了，帮我退了吧。", "expected": {"outcome": "clarify", "eligibility": {"probe": {"order_id": "O2004", "reason_type": "无理由", "item_condition": ""}, "verdict": "需补充", "reason_contains": ["无理由退货的判定取决于商品状态", "未拆封", "已拆封", "已使用"], "refundable_amount": 0.0}, "tools": {"must_call": ["check_refund_eligibility"], "must_not_call": ["execute_refund", "record_refund_denial"], "order": [], "max_calls": {"search_refund_policy": 2}}, "decision_log": null, "answer": {"must_include_receipt_no": false, "must_mention": ["未拆封"], "must_not_mention": []}, "citation": {"prefer_docs": []}}}, {"user": "拆开穿着走了两步，就在屋里没出门。", "expected": {"outcome": "denied", "eligibility": {"probe": {"order_id": "O2004", "reason_type": "无理由", "item_condition": "已使用"}, "verdict": "不通过", "reason_contains": ["商品状态为「已使用」", "无理由退货要求未拆封"], "refundable_amount": 0.0}, "tools": {"must_call": ["get_customer_info", "search_refund_policy", "check_refund_eligibility", "record_refund_denial"], "must_not_call": ["execute_refund"], "order": ["get_customer_info", "search_refund_policy", "check_refund_eligibility", "record_refund_denial"], "max_calls": {"search_refund_policy": 2}}, "decision_log": {"decision": "拒绝", "order_id": "O2004", "amount": 0.0}, "answer": {"must_include_receipt_no": true, "must_mention": ["未拆封"], "must_not_mention": []}, "citation": {"prefer_docs": ["P05"]}}}], "_note": "用户说清了原因（买错码 = 无理由）但没说状态。第二轮「穿着走了两步」是已使用，不是已拆封 —— 本条同时守住追问时机与状态映射两件事。"}
